  "description": {
    "en": "Yonex PolyTour Drive Soft is a softer version of the PolyTour Drive concept, combining an octagonal polyester profile with easy access to power and spin. Designed for players across all swing speeds, it offers more comfort and ball pocketing than standard PolyTour Drive while maintaining the mechanical bite of an eight-sided shaped string. It is particularly suitable for players who want shaped-poly spin without the firmer feel of more demanding strings such as PolyTour Rev or PolyTour Spin.",

    "zh": "Yonex PolyTour Drive Soft 是 PolyTour Drive 的柔和版本，继续采用 Octagonal 八边形聚酯单丝结构，同时进一步强化舒适性、Ball Pocketing 和易用性。官方定位同样适合所有挥拍速度，即使挥拍速度较慢，也能比较容易获得有力量的旋转。相比普通 PolyTour Drive，它更加柔软、Pocketing 更明显；相比 PolyTour Rev 或 PolyTour Spin，则明显更加宽容和容易驾驭，非常适合想尝试异形聚酯但不喜欢过硬线床的球员。"
  },

